Class cSigCjCom_DPushButtonEvents is a Mixin

    { MethodType=Event }
    Procedure OnComClick
    End_Procedure

    { MethodType=Event }
    Procedure OnComMouseDown Short llButton Short llShift OLE_XPOS_PIXELS llx OLE_YPOS_PIXELS lly
    End_Procedure

    { MethodType=Event }
