    Procedure RegisterComEvents
        Send RegisterComEvent 1 msg_OnComBeforeLabelEdit
        Send RegisterComEvent 2 msg_OnComAfterLabelEdit
        Send RegisterComEvent 8 msg_OnComCancelLabelEdit
        Send RegisterComEvent 3 msg_OnComNodeCheck
        Send RegisterComEvent -605 msg_OnComMouseDown
        Send RegisterComEvent -606 msg_OnComMouseMove
        Send RegisterComEvent -607 msg_OnComMouseUp
        Send RegisterComEvent -602 msg_OnComKeyDown
        Send RegisterComEvent -603 msg_OnComKeyPress
        Send RegisterComEvent -604 msg_OnComKeyUp
        Send RegisterComEvent -601 msg_OnComDblClick
        Send RegisterComEvent 4 msg_OnComExpand
        Send RegisterComEvent 5 msg_OnComCollapse
        Send RegisterComEvent 6 msg_OnComNodeClick
        Send RegisterComEvent 7 msg_OnComExpanding
        Send RegisterComEvent 300 msg_OnComOLEDragOver
        Send RegisterComEvent 301 msg_OnComOLEDragDrop
        Send RegisterComEvent 303 msg_OnComOLEStartDrag
        Send RegisterComEvent 304 msg_OnComOLECompleteDrag
        Send RegisterComEvent 305 msg_OnComOLEGiveFeedback
        Send RegisterComEvent 306 msg_OnComOLESetData
        Send RegisterComEvent 10001000 msg_OnComReCreated
    End_Procedure
End_Class

