    End_Procedure

    Procedure ComCommitList
        Handle hDispatchDriver
        Get phDispatchDriver to hDispatchDriver
        Send InvokeComMethod to hDispatchDriver 3 OLE_VT_VOID
    End_Procedure
End_Class

